avatar is staged on its endpoint, connecting otherwise disjoint regions. The avatar can reach and overlap the color-15 object, but reward still does not fire. Because that overlap may collect or alter hidden-in-the-frame state, I’m restoring a cropped full-frame search key so the search preserves such partial progress instead of merging it away.\n\n## Preserved local probes\n\n- `probe_bfs.py` (2907 bytes)\n- `probe_level1_reward.py` (1135 bytes)\n- `probe_level2.py` (4438 bytes)\n- `probe_level2_context.py` (5036 bytes)\n- `probe_level3.py` (2280 bytes)\n- `wip_glue_notes.md` (1168 bytes)\n\nRun or inspect the smallest relevant probe before writing another one.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
